{"pin":"BH01580","subcodes":[{"code":"BH01580","anchor":"","first_line":"O My Messenger! Grieve not for that which hath befallen thee. By My life! Thou art beneath the wing of thy Lord's grace, the Mighty, the All-Praised. I bear witness that thou [3.5s]... ...I beseech Thee, O Thou the best Beloved of the worlds and God of all in the heavens and on earth, to grant that I be confirmed in Thy love and steadfast under Thy command","first_line_orig":"رسولی لاتحزن عما ورد علیک لعمری انک تحت جناح فضل ربک العزیز الحمید اشهد انک  ","language":"Ara","word_count":"550","notes":" \u003ca href=\"https://bahai-library.com/bahailib/1504.pdf#page=120\"\u003eMMAH.108\u003c/a\u003e,  \u003ca href=\"https://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/o/GS/gs-180.html\"\u003eGSH.180\u003c/a\u003e,  \u003ca href=\"http://web.archive.org/web/20070930181707/http://bahai-library.com/resources/leiden.list/leiden.list.html#219\"\u003eLL#219\u003c/a\u003e","translations":[{"language":"ar","lang_name":"Arabic"},{"language":"orig","lang_name":"Original"}],"refs":[{"kind":"manuscript","code":"BLIB_Or11095#004","source":"BLIB_Or11095","locator":"004"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"BLIB_Or15707.045","source":"BLIB_Or15707","locator":"045"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"BLIB_Or15735.214","source":"BLIB_Or15735","locator":"214"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA34:130","source":"INBA34","locator":"130","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/inba_v034/?page=132"},{"kind":"publication","code":"ADM2#039 p.066x","source":"ADM2","locator":"039 p.066x","url":"https://bahai-library.com/bahailib/558.pdf#page=66"},{"kind":"publication","code":"AQA1#016","source":"AQA1","locator":"016","url":"https://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/b/Q1/q1-21.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"HYK.214","source":"HYK","locator":"214"},{"kind":"publication","code":"OOL.B072","source":"OOL","locator":"B072","url":"https://oceanoflights.org/bahaullah-st-072-ar"},{"kind":"translation","code":"JHT_S#039x","source":"JHT_S","locator":"039x","url":"https://joshua